DEVICE SPIKE

# Rover basics 5 - canyon beacon (reference solution): straight, turn, straight.
DEFINE quarter turn right:
  set movement speed 15
  reset yaw
  start moving steering 100
  wait until spike angle yaw > 87
  stop movement

WHEN flag clicked:
  set movement motors A B
  set movement speed 50
  move forward 70 cm
  quarter turn right
  set movement speed 50
  move forward 50 cm
